abstract: >-
  Code, leakage-aware grouped cross-validation splits, duplicate groups and final results for the paper
  "Leakage-Aware Re-evaluation, Confidence Calibration, and Conformal Selective Prediction for Trustworthy
  Real-World Waste Classification". The pipeline detects exact and near-duplicate images (MD5, pHash/dHash,
  DINOv2 cosine), builds grouped stratified five-fold splits with separate calibration-fit and
  conformal-calibration subsets, trains six architectures on RealWaste, TrashNet and TrashBox (252 runs),
  evaluates temperature/vector scaling, MC dropout and deep ensembles, split conformal prediction (LAC, APS,
  RAPS; marginal and Mondrian) and selective prediction, and regenerates every table and figure of the paper.
